UTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 afd4f9cf-b874-4584-b420-996a7045d175 / v5：对应本次当前结果\n\n5. \"LOCAL_CASE_RECORD_RECHECK\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 c6d3e5fc-99de-4749-9a5c-2070f58fd262 / v6：对应本次当前结果\n\n资格：NOT_EVALUATED；外部受理：NOT_SUBMITTED；线下履约：NO_EVIDENCE；Case目标未完成。\n原采用来源和旧计划只作为历史引用；当前所有目标均在上方保留。\n原行/原来源指纹引用原接口完整投影；导出的白名单子对象不用于重算这些原指纹。下方整包核对数据指纹可按JSON规范化重算。\n核对数据 SHA256：b8edf6a0a2cc3aeaf22008e6fec820a3d8bcf1f5c11e8098509756820f4aeb22\n核对数据（UTF-8 JSON，原文按JSON转义；不包含读取凭据）：\n{\n  \"actor_id\": \"fixture-a\",\n  \"preparation_id\": \"25fd51de-36dc-464a-9e0a-88ad74a1fb06\",\n  \"case_id\": \"9931038f-7fc5-4ee3-87c6-538f994f6435\",\n  \"run_id\": \"2a5f4999-0c3e-4d02-9e78-80d693c64c30\",\n  \"preparation_revision\": 8,\n  \"request_revision\": 6,\n  \"current_request\": \"SYNTHETIC current ordinary outputs\",\n  \"original_request\": \"PRIVATE_REQUEST_A\",\n  \"plan_id\": \"dd449e51-5393-4c1b-a5a7-b393580c17f8\",\n  \"plan_revision\": 6,\n  \"state\": \"LOCAL_OUTPUTS_VERIFIED\",\n  \"read_only\": true,\n  \"automatically_verified\": false,\n  \"case_goal_completed\": false,\n  \"qualification\": \"NOT_EVALUATED\",\n  \"external_acceptance\": \"NOT_SUBMITTED\",\n  \"offline_fulfillment\": \"NO_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_CASE_RECORD_PACK_V1\",\n  \"source_scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_ADOPTED_LOCAL_GOAL_RESULTS_ONLY\",\n  \"current_required_goals\": [\n    \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_CASE_RESOURCE_ASSOCIATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_INTERNAL_ACCEPTANCE\",\n    \"LOCAL_SYNTHETIC_RECEIPT_ACKNOWLEDGEMENT\",\n    \"LOCAL_CASE_RECORD_RECHECK\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"goal\": \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\",\n      \"title\": \"当前材料的人工核对与企业确认\",\n      \"adapter_id\": \"P1\",\n      \"step_id\": \"47d7c9c6-fc72-48cb-9b19-0bc0a0db9f47\",\n      \"state\": \"LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\",\n      \"next_action\": null,\n      \"adoption_trace_sha256\": \"f7ee3fa7d7be7b6475242419d21